⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
303 calories 24g protein (for the entire pint, toppings/mix-ins included)

Tiramisu Topped Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 145 recipes like this one!

- 400g Fat Free High Protein Milk
- 40g Monk Fruit sweetener
- 15g mascarpone
- 5g (1 tsp) @NielsenMassey vanilla bean paste (or extract)
- A pinch of salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) @bobsredmill xanthan gum
Mix-ins/toppings:
- 10g @highkeysnacks3818 Vanilla Wafers (can sub with Nilla Wafers)
- 10g chocolate covered espresso beans (mix in all but one - save one bean, chop it up finely and top with it at the end)
- 15g (1 tbsp) @LakantoOfficial Chocolate Sauce (can sub with any sugar-free chocolate syrup except Hershey’s - it sucks)
303 cal 26g C, 14g F, 24g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting (if necessary)
5. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with the chopped espresso beans and wafers
6. Run the “Mix-in” cycle
7. Top with the chocolate syrup and the last chopped up bean

